                <head>Agreement between the United States and Canada amending agreement of January
                    27, 1943, regarding post-war disposition of defense installations and
                    facilities</head>
                <p>[Effected by exchange of notes signed at Washington November 22 and December 20,
                    1944. For text of notes, see Department of State Executive Agreement Series No.
                    444, or 58 Stat. (pt. 2) 1565. For text of original agreement, see Executive
                    Agreement Series No. 391, or 57 Stat, (pt.2) 1429.]</p>
